{"unit_id":"TaylorSwitiger__dsh-plan-bridge#caveat-qwen-beta","repo":"TaylorSwitiger/dsh-plan-bridge","commit":"f5063f8ee963551a4cc0989128de51f6f83424cf","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plan-bridge 使用前须知：Qwen 套餐在源码中标为 beta，说明上游转发尚未用真实 key 验证；启用需要先在 DSH 凭据库配置对应 key（见 lib/adapters/qwen.js:8-10）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/adapters/qwen.js:8-10","lib/adapters/qwen.js:22-32"]}
